I have the new card in my hand.
I walk to the gate.
I scan the card there.
The gate opens.
I go to the platform.
Soon, the metro train arrives.
The doors open.
I board the train.
There is AC in the train.
So it is very cool inside.
I need to get to the water metro terminal.
I see a seat near the window.
I sit in that seat.
The train goes forward.
I look outside through the window.
I see the large buildings of the city.
Many vehicles are going on the road below.
This journey is very easy.
